Keys act on the selected EVSE.

↑ ↓  k j    select an EVSE
r           reserve it for the default tag (auth.default_id_tag), 15 minutes
c           cancel its reservation
s           start a session with the default tag
x           stop its session (asks first)
u           unlock the cable
t           ask the station for its status again
?           this help
q  ctrl-c   quit cpms

Other tags, expiry, limits: run the CLI in another terminal, for example:
  cpms reserve --evse <uid> --tag <tag> --expires 30m

Full log:
  /var/lib/cpms/cpms.log












? or esc closes